dden="true" focusable="false"><rect x="5" y="2" width="14" height="20" rx="7"></rect><path d="M12 6v4"></path></svg></span><span class="t">Right-click a link, then Save link to Kefli</span></div></div></section><details class="adv" open=""><summary data-act="adv"><span class="ic"><svg width="20" height="20" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.75" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true" focusable="false"><path d="M20 7h-9"></path><path d="M14 17H5"></path><circle cx="17" cy="17" r="3"></circle><circle cx="7" cy="7" r="3"></circle></svg></span><span class="t">Advanced</span><span class="chev"><span class="chevr"><svg width="18" height="18" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.75" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true" focusable="false"><path d="m9 18 6-6-6-6"></path></svg></span></span></summary><section class="sect" style="margin-top:var(--space-8)"><h2>Relays</h2><div class="list"><div class="li edge-t"><span class="ic"><svg width="20" height="20" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.75" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true" focusable="false"><rect width="20" height="8" x="2" y="2" rx="2" ry="2"></rect><rect width="20" height="8" x="2" y="14" rx="2" ry="2"></rect><line x1="6" x2="6.01" y1="6" y2="6"></line><line x1="6" x2="6.01" y1="18" y2="18"></line></svg></span><span class="t">Kefli<small>relay.example</small></span></div><div class="li"><span class="ic"><svg width="20" height="20" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.75" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true" focusable="false"><rect width="20" height="8" x="2" y="2" rx="2" ry="2"></rect><rect width="20" height="8" x="2" y="14" rx="2" ry="2"></rect><line x1="6" x2="6.01" y1="6" y2="6"></line><line x1="6" x2="6.01" y1="18" y2="18"></line></svg></span><span class="t">Backup 1<small>a.example/</small></span></div><div class="li edge-b"><span class="ic"><svg width="20" height="20" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.75" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true" focusable="false"><rect width="20" height="8" x="2" y="2" rx="2" ry="2"></rect><rect width="20" height="8" x="2" y="14" rx="2" ry="2"></rect><line x1="6" x2="6.01" y1="6" y2="6"></line><line x1="6" x2="6.01" y1="18" y2="18"></line></svg></span><span class="t">Your relay<small>mine.example</small></span></div></div><p class="fine">Set by your phone when you connected this browser.</p></section><section class="sect"><h2>This browser</h2><div class="list"><div class="li edge-t edge-b"><span class="ic"><svg width="20" height="20" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.75" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true" focusable="false"><circle cx="12" cy="12" r="10"></circle><path d="M12 16v-4"></path><path d="M12 8h.01"></path></svg></span><span class="t">Kefli 1.0.1<small>store · abc1234</small></span><button class="chip" data-act="debug">Copied</button></div></div><p class="fine">For a bug report. It lists what became of your last twenty saves, without their addresses or titles, and nothing that could open them.</p></section></details><div class="sect"><div class="confirm" role="group" aria-labelledby="unpairhead"><h2 id="unpairhead">Disconnect this browser?</h2><p>4 saves haven’t reached your phone yet. Disconnecting deletes them from this browser. This browser will stop sending saves to your phone. To stop it completely, also remove it under Connected browsers on your phone.</p><div class="row"><button class="btn secondary" data-act="unpair-cancel">Cancel</button><button class="btn danger" data-act="unpair-yes">Disconnect and delete 4 saves</button></div></div></div></div>"`;

